        2030          1,807           5,993           5,150              7,001  n  n3.The Group has adopted Ind AS 116 – Leases, with effect from April 1, 2019 by using modified retrospective approach and accordingly comparatives for the year ended March 31, 2019 have not been adjusted retrospectively. Consequently, the Group has not restated the comparative figures and cumulative effect of initially applying this Standard have been recognised as adjustment to opening balance of retained earnings as on April 1, 2019.   n4.During the quarter ended December 31, 2019, the Company has allotted 321,925 equity shares of Rs.2 each, fully paid-up, on exercise of stock options by employees, in accordance with the Company's stock option scheme.  n5.Figures for earlier periods have been regrouped, wherever necessary.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
